      "content": "but that's the thing... it's not just \"small steps.\" it's like i'm running on a treadmill that only goes faster every time i trip. it feels less like a \"path to healing\" and more like i'm just delaying the inevitable. it's so heavy. i just want the noise in my head to stop.",
